Test ID     508
Comment     should build mfrac
Client ID   1
Engine      MuPAD
Command ID	Interpret
   <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
     <mn>1</mn>
     <mo form="infix">/</mo>
     <mo form="prefix" fence="true" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">(</mo>
     <mn>3</mn>
     <mi>x</mi>
     <mo form="infix">+</mo>
     <mn>4</mn>
     <mo form="postfix" fence="true" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">)</mo>
   </math>
End of test

Test ID     509
Comment     should build mfrac
